    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005030090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……そ、そんなに？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700503/1007005030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はい！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あなたの笑顔と気さくな雰囲気に一目惚れしたんです\r\nあなたにアイドルになってもらえたら、って……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お伝えしたとおり、自分はまだまだ駆け出しで、\r\nそんな人間の言葉じゃ説得力はないかもしれないけど──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は絶対にあなたをプロデュースしたいと思っていて、\r\nだから──！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005030100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あーあーあー、お兄さーん",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close6",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700503/1007005030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005030110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "めちゃめちゃ買ってくださってありがとうなんですけど、\r\n一旦……ちょっと……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700503/1007005030110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──あっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0888",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……\r\nお恥ずかしいところをお見せしました……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……でも、どれも本心なんです\r\n俺はこの間、あなただと思った",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなわけで、前向きな返事をもらえたのが\r\n嬉しくてつい……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……っていうのは、反省が足りてないかな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005030120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あはは",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700503/1007005030120",
    "autoWaitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "1461",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005030130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……すごく熱意を持って向き合ってくださってるんだって\r\n伝わりました。ありがとうございます。嬉しいです",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700503/1007005030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005030140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "お兄さんに担当してもらえるなら、っていう安心感も\r\nすごく持ててます",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700503/1007005030140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005030150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "まぁただ、私にそんなポテンシャルがあるかどうか\r\nっていうと、また別の話なんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700503/1007005030150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは心配しなくても──！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005030160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あは、めっちゃ褒めてもらえる",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700503/1007005030160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005030170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……才能は約束できないんですけど、やってみたい\r\nそういう形でも大丈夫でしょうか？　というのと……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700503/1007005030170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005030180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "私ひとりでは決められないので──",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
