    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700503/1007005030180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、それはもちろん\r\n親御さんにも説明に伺います",
