    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700503/1007005030210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さっきの質問。才能は、俺が保証する──というか、\r\nあなたが輝けるように支えたいと思って声をかけました",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、一緒に頑張ってもらえるだけで\r\n俺には十分なんです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005030220,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700503/1007005030220",
    "autoWaitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005030230,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "じゃあ、一生懸命頑張りますね！\r\nよろしくお願いします！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700503/1007005030230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──ありがとう！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その言葉が聞けて嬉しいよ、結華……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
